      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>Inserts the given entity and assigns an ID (if required).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>Updates the given entity.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>Removes all entities of the matching type.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>Returns the entity of the given type with its matching ID.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>Returns all entities of the matching type.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"6\"></i><b>6</b></td>\n<td>Returns a <code>List</code> of all entities of the given type that match the criteria of the query.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<tbody><tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"1\"></i><b>1</b></td>\n<td>插入给定的实体并分配 ID（如需要）。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"2\"></i><b>2</b></td>\n<td>更新给定的实体。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"3\"></i><b>3</b></td>\n<td>删除所有匹配类型的实体。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"4\"></i><b>4</b></td>\n<td>返回给定类型且 ID 匹配的实体。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"5\"></i><b>5</b></td>\n<td>返回所有匹配类型的实体。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i class=\"conum\" data-value=\"6\"></i><b>6</b></td>\n<td>返回一个 <code>List</code>，包含所有符合查询条件的给定类型实体。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
